{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as Narak, a deadly mercenary on a dangerous quest for redemption after failing to stop a catastrophic event. Parkour your way through bustling chaos, unleash brutal &amp; stylish moves, and fight for the ultimate freedom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Hand-drawn Animations</strong></u> - Every animation is meticulously hand-drawn and sprite-based, showcasing a level of detail and craftsmanship that brings every movement to life with unmatched fluidity and precision.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872630/extras/Narak_3Hit_Combo_1.gif?t=1745069586\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>2D Hack'n'Slash Combat</u></strong> - Dive yourself into stylish-combat where every fight is a fast-paced frenzy. Combine different weapons to unleash deadly combos and slice through waves of enemies. Hack-n-Slash your way to protect your ultimate freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Parkour Platforming</u></strong> - Traverse your way through the city filled with dangerous obstacles. Make use of Parkour moves available in your move set. Run, Jump, Wall Jump, Roll, Run along the Wall, Grapple and more your way through the bustling chaos of the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872630/extras/GhostYantra_HorzWallRun_1.gif?t=1745069586\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Manga inspired Cutscenes</u></strong> - Unravel the story of Narak through immersive, manga-inspired cutscenes. Featuring hand-drawn panels that capture dynamic action and intricate details.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872630/extras/GhostYantra_Manga_Cutscene.png?t=1745069586\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Welcome to Indian Cyberpunk</u></strong> - Discover a groundbreaking Indian Cyberpunk setting where traditional culture &amp; iconography merge with Cyberpunk aesthetics. Vibrant motifs, ancient symbols, and futuristic technology collide to create a unique fusion that redefines both genres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872630/extras/Environment_Atmosphere_2.png?t=1745069586\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872630/extras/GhostYantra_BossBattle.png?t=1745069586\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2872630?t=1745069586","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2872630?t=1745069586","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872630/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745069586","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872630/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745069586","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as Narak, a deadly mercenary on a dangerous quest for redemption after failing to stop a catastrophic event. Parkour your way through bustling chaos, unleash brutal &amp; stylish moves, and fight for the ultimate freedom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Hand-drawn Animations</strong></u> -